# The build context of packages/render/container/Dockerfile (the
# SmogRenderer image, phase 7 ruling 17) is the repository root. Its first
# stage runs `turbo prune @smog/render --docker`, which needs the workspace
# manifests, the lockfile and the pruned packages' sources only.
